Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?cps2w:=20vsavjw=20catalogue=20=E2=80=94=20the?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20SHIPPING=20NAME=20(VampireSaved=2014z-126b,=20merged-m14):?=
